# Allowlist: nothing reaches the build unless it is named here, so a .env,
# saved tokens, TLS keys, the data directory or .git in the working directory
# can never end up in the image.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
# The multi-stage Dockerfile compiles these in the build stage; only the
# compiled output reaches the runtime image. Add new modules as .ts files and
# nothing else needs to be listed.
!*.ts
# Tests are not part of the image
*.test.ts
